          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "The review covers both preclinical (mouse) and clinical (human) data; distinctions must be maintained when attributing findings to human applicability.",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::16691695321f5acfe09a283c"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0291"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::d8ed7fc7fc933274280a7ac1",
          "source_handle": "P0291",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "Identified bacterial taxa and metabolites show inconsistency across studies; do not present them as universal predictors without noting context-dependence (tumor type, geography, methodology).",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::16691695321f5acfe09a283c"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
