          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0295"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::e4a641ef4e64ed5c6657e51d",
          "source_handle": "P0295",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ],
          "value": "review",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::a5c3368011d84ece3131c8dd"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0295"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::d645e59bbd1d7226bdf4c703",
          "source_handle": "P0295",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ],
          "value": "动机在于尽管ICI疗法在某些癌症亚组中显示出持久疗效，但患者反应差异巨大且缺乏有效的预测生物标志物。已知肠道微生物群可能调节ICI疗效，但具体哪些微生物特征与反应相关尚不明确。本研究试图通过系统综述厘清粪便微生物群组成与ICI治疗反应（响应vs无响应）之间的关联模式。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::a5c3368011d84ece3131c8dd"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0295"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::19de0255db9ece45e8630f66",
          "source_handle": "P0295",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ],
          "value": "针对接受免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI，包括抗PD-1、抗PD-L1或抗CTLA-4）治疗的实体瘤患者，研究其粪便肠道微生物群组成与ICI治疗反应之间的关联。涵盖的癌症类型包括转移性黑色素瘤（MM）、非小细胞肺癌（NSCLC）、转移性肾细胞癌（mRCC）、肝细胞癌（HCC）和胃肠道癌症。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::a5c3368011d84ece3131c8dd"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0295"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::f6491012a4293912ddddd53f",
          "source_handle": "P0295",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ],
          "value": "这是一篇2023年发表的系统综述，旨在调查肠道微生物群作为预测生物标志物的潜力。作者遵循PRISMA指南，检索了EMBASE、Medline和Cochrane Library数据库，筛选出18项涉及775名实体瘤患者的队列研究。由于各研究在测序方法（16S rRNA、宏基因组鸟枪法测序等）、癌症类型及反应定义上的异质性，无法进行定量荟萃分析，因此采用定性叙事综合的方法。研究识别出与良好预后（响应者）和不良预后（无响应者）相关的特定细菌物种，并讨论了不同技术方法和混杂因素对结果解释的影响。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::a5c3368011d84ece3131c8dd"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0295"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::049c91454bbba7e4bdf1eb58",
          "source_handle": "P0295",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "仅展示观察性关联，不涉及因果机制。结果受限于原始研究的定义（如RECIST标准 vs irRC标准）和测序深度。不能直接外推至所有ICI药物或所有癌症类型，需结合具体癌症背景使用。",
            "contribution": "提供了具体的细菌物种列表及其与ICI疗效（响应/无响应）的关联方向。例如，确认了F. prausnitzii, S. parasanguinis, B. caccae, P. copri常出现在响应者中，而B. obeum, B. ovatus常出现在无响应者中。",
            "facet_id": "F1"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::a5c3368011d84ece3131c8dd"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0295"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::320c7d3b927b05662dea04a9",
          "source_handle": "P0295",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "本综述未进行功能富集分析或代谢通路分析，因此提供的机制信息是间接的、基于文献引用的，而非本研究的新发现。不能替代专门的机制研究来解释“如何”调节。",
            "contribution": "在讨论部分简要提及了一些细菌的功能背景（如F. prausnitzii维持肠道稳态，B. obeum可能具有抗生素抗性），并引用了其他研究关于FMT（粪菌移植）克服耐药性的案例。",
            "facet_id": "F2"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::a5c3368011d84ece3131c8dd"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0295"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::14f48a9c0511bfb3c2367595",
          "source_handle": "P0295",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "讨论了16S rRNA测序与宏基因组鸟枪法测序（MSS）的技术差异，指出前者覆盖率高但偏差大，后者可分析功能但成本高且易受宿主DNA干扰。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::a5c3368011d84ece3131c8dd"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0295"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::d5d6f1a93b34ca48b5be8c47",
          "source_handle": "P0295",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "提到粪便样本与黏膜微生物群的差异，以及粪便样本可能无法完全代表与宿主免疫系统相互作用的黏膜相关菌群。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::a5c3368011d84ece3131c8dd"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0295"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::6641e04e62791a2d4b376814",
          "source_handle": "P0295",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "提及FMT在黑色素瘤患者中恢复ICI响应的案例研究。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::a5c3368011d84ece3131c8dd"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0295"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::edbbd751ab16d1eae729ec05",
          "source_handle": "P0295",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "该综述包含的是观察性关联，而非因果关系。细菌的存在可能与疗效相关，但不一定导致疗效。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::a5c3368011d84ece3131c8dd"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0295"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::ce0f3c36bf1bb726074ca4f9",
          "source_handle": "P0295",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "结果受到原始研究中“响应者”定义不一致的影响（部分研究将稳定疾病SD视为响应，部分视为无响应），这可能导致某些细菌的分类模糊。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::a5c3368011d84ece3131c8dd"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0295"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::c2e2a294c7c188e4f32b612e",
          "source_handle": "P0295",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "不同癌症类型的微生物背景不同，不能简单地将一种癌症中发现的细菌标志物推广到其他癌症，除非有跨癌症的一致证据。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::a5c3368011d84ece3131c8dd"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0295"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::6d04e4e129cf4c658534c39d",
          "source_handle": "P0295",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "由于未进行定量荟萃分析，所谓的“最常被报道”是基于频率的定性判断，而非统计学上的显著优势比。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::a5c3368011d84ece3131c8dd"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0295"
        },
