        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::7461ad3c4c0c2a31011107c3",
          "source_handle": "P0310",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ],
          "value": "基于肠道微生物群可能调节癌症治疗反应的假设，以及广谱抗生素已知会导致菌群失调的事实，本研究试图验证近期抗生素暴露是否会恶化接受ICI治疗的黑色素瘤患者的临床结局（生存率和免疫相关不良反应）。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::cbe0edda2ebe4eadd9e19df3"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch6",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_006\\b56751a8f394813e6767aa8efd24825055cb0b332ed100bfcc9c8be800506c10\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0310"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::f4b855dc46eb6cf5882b401b",
          "source_handle": "P0310",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ],
          "value": "研究对象为接受免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗的III期和IV期黑色素瘤患者。研究情境为单中心机构数据库回顾性分析，时间跨度为2004年至2019年。主要关注抗生素暴露与ICI治疗结局之间的关联。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::cbe0edda2ebe4eadd9e19df3"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch6",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_006\\b56751a8f394813e6767aa8efd24825055cb0b332ed100bfcc9c8be800506c10\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0310"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::c5cb1f53f3ca4d8fdfb3bff2",
          "source_handle": "P0310",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ],
          "value": "本研究旨在探讨近期抗生素暴露是否会影响黑色素瘤患者对免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）的治疗反应。研究团队从机构数据库中识别了接受首次ICI治疗的患者，定义抗生素暴露为在首次ICI输注前3个月内使用过抗生素。主要终点为总生存期（OS），次要终点为需要静脉注射类固醇治疗的免疫介导性结肠炎。研究分别对III期和IV期患者进行了独立分析，并通过多变量分析调整了基线特征差异。结果显示，抗生素暴露与较差的生存预后及更高的结肠炎风险相关。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::cbe0edda2ebe4eadd9e19df3"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch6",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_006\\b56751a8f394813e6767aa8efd24825055cb0b332ed100bfcc9c8be800506c10\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0310"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::28c627cde2bc02253af2e056",
          "source_handle": "P0310",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "仅限黑色素瘤；未提供微生物组直接证据；关联不等于因果；未区分抗生素类型或具体菌群变化。",
            "contribution": "提供了抗生素暴露作为负面调节因子影响ICI疗效的具体临床数据。数据显示，在III期和IV期黑色素瘤中，近期抗生素使用均与OS降低显著相关（HR分别为2.8和1.6），并增加了严重结肠炎风险（HR 2.1）。",
            "facet_id": "F1"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::cbe0edda2ebe4eadd9e19df3"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch6",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_006\\b56751a8f394813e6767aa8efd24825055cb0b332ed100bfcc9c8be800506c10\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0310"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::47907cfa1f0dc904c801a146",
          "source_handle": "P0310",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "缺乏直接的微生物组数据或机制通路验证；不能单独证明机制，需结合其他微生物组学研究。",
            "contribution": "虽然未直接阐明分子机制，但通过展示抗生素暴露与不良临床结局（OS下降、结肠炎增加）的强关联，为“微生物群介导的ICI疗效调节”这一机制假说提供了间接的支持性临床背景。其敏感性分析排除了重症感染本身的直接影响，增强了抗生素本身（而非伴随疾病）作用的合理性。",
            "facet_id": "F2"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::cbe0edda2ebe4eadd9e19df3"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch6",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_006\\b56751a8f394813e6767aa8efd24825055cb0b332ed100bfcc9c8be800506c10\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0310"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::2b7f0708ccb2944b9f85dc1f",
          "source_handle": "P0310",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "抗生素暴露导致OS风险增加1.6-2.8倍，结肠炎风险增加2.1倍的统计数据。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::cbe0edda2ebe4eadd9e19df3"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch6",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_006\\b56751a8f394813e6767aa8efd24825055cb0b332ed100bfcc9c8be800506c10\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0310"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::b2a1d9834cb883ad2f9be332",
          "source_handle": "P0310",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "研究专门分析了III期和IV期黑色素瘤，发现两期别均有显著负面影响，但III期的HR更高（2.8 vs 1.6）。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::cbe0edda2ebe4eadd9e19df3"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch6",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_006\\b56751a8f394813e6767aa8efd24825055cb0b332ed100bfcc9c8be800506c10\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0310"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::346848d789c8afc9b21ef58d",
          "source_handle": "P0310",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "该研究为观察性关联，不能推断抗生素必然导致疗效下降，可能存在未测量的混杂因素（尽管已调整多项基线特征）。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::cbe0edda2ebe4eadd9e19df3"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch6",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_006\\b56751a8f394813e6767aa8efd24825055cb0b332ed100bfcc9c8be800506c10\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
