        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::ee9290b766872c91edb7c21a",
          "source_handle": "P0310",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "结果仅适用于黑色素瘤患者，外推至其他实体瘤需谨慎。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::cbe0edda2ebe4eadd9e19df3"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch6",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_006\\b56751a8f394813e6767aa8efd24825055cb0b332ed100bfcc9c8be800506c10\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0310"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::1a7f6ea250253d8f35605ddb",
          "source_handle": "P0310",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "抗生素定义为“3个月内使用”，未区分抗生素种类、疗程或给药途径（除敏感性分析排除静脉用药外），不同抗生素对菌群的影响差异巨大，此处视为整体暴露。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::cbe0edda2ebe4eadd9e19df3"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch6",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_006\\b56751a8f394813e6767aa8efd24825055cb0b332ed100bfcc9c8be800506c10\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0310"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::fcea8fd55aaa119633dde462",
          "source_handle": "P0310",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "结肠炎风险的增加可能与生存期缩短有关（竞争风险），Fine-Grey模型已部分处理此问题，但仍需注意解释。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::cbe0edda2ebe4eadd9e19df3"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch6",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_006\\b56751a8f394813e6767aa8efd24825055cb0b332ed100bfcc9c8be800506c10\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
