          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0323"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::b27d11a4cf958b094b9096a4",
          "source_handle": "P0323",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ],
          "value": "作为一篇综述，本文采用概念扩展与多组学综合路线。首先，通过类比宇宙学中的“暗物质”，提出并定义“癌症暗物质”的新内涵，将其从单纯的癌细胞内在异常扩展到整个肿瘤微环境的复杂相互作用。其次，分章节详细论述不同层面的“暗物质”：1) 病毒模拟（VM）及其引发的免疫反应；2) 非编码RNA（T-UCRs）和非规范蛋白（ncORFs）的作用；3) 多组学技术（基因组、转录组、蛋白质组、代谢组、离子组、微生物组）在识别这些要素中的应用；4) 人工智能在多组学数据整合与分析中的作用。最后，探讨针对这些“暗物质”的治疗策略，如液体活检监测、基于ncORF的免疫疗法及微生物组调节。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::65e5130149e6543e9b316449"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0323"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::e27bbd4e1149741c27e65033",
          "source_handle": "P0323",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits"
          ],
          "value": {
            "contribution": "提出了“癌症暗物质”的扩展定义，将研究视角从单一的癌细胞内在突变扩展到包含微生物组、代谢物和离子平衡在内的整个TME生态系统。",
            "limits": "所给摘要未交代具体的实验验证数据，主要为理论框架和文献综述；对于某些机制（如特定ncORF的功能）的详细分子路径描述可能依赖于引用而非本研究原创数据。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::65e5130149e6543e9b316449"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0323"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::52c38d7e3a9d69f7fec13c01",
          "source_handle": "P0323",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits"
          ],
          "value": {
            "contribution": "系统总结了多组学技术（特别是质谱、单细胞测序、宏基因组学）在揭示癌症免疫学隐藏层面上的应用潜力和方法论进展。",
            "limits": "所给摘要未交代各技术在实际临床转化中的具体成功率、成本效益分析或标准化程度；部分技术应用仍处于早期阶段。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::65e5130149e6543e9b316449"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0323"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::8d0dc0277036cb1f22c8130d",
          "source_handle": "P0323",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits"
          ],
          "value": {
            "contribution": "强调了“病毒模拟”作为连接表观遗传异常与固有免疫反应的关键桥梁，为增强免疫治疗敏感性提供了新的机制解释。",
            "limits": "所给摘要未交代VM在不同癌症类型中的普遍性差异及个体间变异的具体量化数据；VM诱导的细胞死亡与免疫原性细胞死亡（ICD）的重叠机制尚需更多实证支持。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::65e5130149e6543e9b316449"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0323"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::6dba659dc8e8f1a92e6f3d8a",
          "source_handle": "P0323",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "在癌症细胞中，特别是在存在表观遗传失调或DNA损伤的情况下",
            "finding": "内源性逆转录病毒（ERVs）的激活导致双链RNA（dsRNA）积累，引发“病毒模拟”（VM），进而激活干扰素刺激基因（ISGs），招募并激活CD8+ T细胞，形成免疫排斥常数（ICR）特征。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::65e5130149e6543e9b316449"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0323"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::196a97718b5b6019ccd08b7d",
          "source_handle": "P0323",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "在非编码基因组区域",
            "finding": "非规范开放阅读框（ncORFs）和转录超保守区域（T-UCRs）可产生非规范肽段或调控性RNA，这些产物在正常组织中不表达，因此被视为“外来”抗原，具有高度免疫原性，可作为个性化免疫治疗的靶点。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::65e5130149e6543e9b316449"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0323"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::704d0e893ed1e1ad020b1e48",
          "source_handle": "P0323",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "在肿瘤微环境（TME）中",
            "finding": "肠道和肿瘤驻留微生物群通过代谢产物、免疫细胞信号和表观遗传修饰调节宿主免疫反应，特定细菌物种（如Bifidobacterium, Akkermansia muciniphila）与免疫检查点抑制剂（CPI）疗效正相关，而其他物种（如Fusobacterium nucleatum）则促进免疫逃逸。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::65e5130149e6543e9b316449"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
