        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::679f65a7a246700078865033",
          "source_handle": "P0329",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ],
          "value": "empirical",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::668c479a5777d8a189e172af",
            "snapshot::7f4d4d07befb7d6373432503"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch5",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_005\\c8a8e196a35945b70bab58ac7d25825d55761abfe16e04e3930ca8753de1bb61\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0329"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::b5b1d19764f6694dbdc7af78",
          "source_handle": "P0329",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ],
          "value": "现有研究中单个微生物物种与ICI响应的关联往往不可重复且统计效力不足；虽然FMT显示有益，但药物开发多集中于简单菌群组合。本研究试图在模型中复制FMT的治疗益处，并设计能够增强ICI响应的治疗性微生物组合。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::668c479a5777d8a189e172af",
            "snapshot::7f4d4d07befb7d6373432503"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch5",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_005\\c8a8e196a35945b70bab58ac7d25825d55761abfe16e04e3930ca8753de1bb61\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0329"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::ae8542404f12e8b138fd3320",
          "source_handle": "P0329",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ],
          "value": "基于418名非小细胞肺癌（NSCLC）患者的基线肠道微生物组数据，构建机器学习模型以预测免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）的响应情况；并在模拟环境中评估粪菌移植（FMT）及设计型活细菌疗法对ICI疗效的影响。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::668c479a5777d8a189e172af",
            "snapshot::7f4d4d07befb7d6373432503"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch5",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_005\\c8a8e196a35945b70bab58ac7d25825d55761abfe16e04e3930ca8753de1bb61\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0329"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::4ae34442850db6176f0dc26c",
          "source_handle": "P0329",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ],
          "value": "该研究旨在解决个体微生物物种与ICI响应关联缺乏统计稳健性的问题，并探索通过微生物组干预改善ICI疗效的策略。作者利用418名NSCLC患者的基线微生物组数据训练了一个区分响应者（R）与非响应者（NR）的机器学习模型（AUC=0.62）。随后，在具有良好预测价值的子集（n=257）中，通过模拟实验评估了健康供体FMT和自定义治疗性菌群组合的效果。结果显示，增加FMT或治疗性菌群的定植比例可依赖性地提高模型预测的响应率。结论认为这些候选疗法有潜力改善ICI患者响应，目前正进行菌株分离培养以开发联合疗法。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::668c479a5777d8a189e172af",
            "snapshot::7f4d4d07befb7d6373432503"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch5",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_005\\c8a8e196a35945b70bab58ac7d25825d55761abfe16e04e3930ca8753de1bb61\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0329"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::8ac1b1eac700149a344ed443",
          "source_handle": "P0329",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "模型性能中等（AUC 0.62），且仅在NSCLC队列中验证，外推至其他实体瘤需谨慎。所给摘要未交代模型的可解释性（即哪些具体菌群驱动了预测）。",
            "contribution": "提供了基于全谱微生物组而非单一物种的ICI响应预测模型构建方法，并量化了模型性能（AUC 0.62）。",
            "facet_id": "F1"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::668c479a5777d8a189e172af",
            "snapshot::7f4d4d07befb7d6373432503"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch5",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_005\\c8a8e196a35945b70bab58ac7d25825d55761abfe16e04e3930ca8753de1bb61\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0329"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::a23aef9604c65bbc592eb585",
          "source_handle": "P0329",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "这是基于计算机模拟的结果，非体内或体外实验验证。所给摘要未交代具体的分子机制（如抗原呈递、炎症调节等），仅停留在表型预测层面。",
            "contribution": "提出了通过“恢复响应者样微生物组特征”来克服ICI无响应的设计策略，并通过模拟证明了FMT和定制菌群的潜在有效性。",
            "facet_id": "F2"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::668c479a5777d8a189e172af",
            "snapshot::7f4d4d07befb7d6373432503"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch5",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_005\\c8a8e196a35945b70bab58ac7d25825d55761abfe16e04e3930ca8753de1bb61\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0329"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::9427443eb0fa7c8aa3845ea9",
          "source_handle": "P0329",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "418名NSCLC患者的基线微生物组数据及其与ICI响应的统计关联分析。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::668c479a5777d8a189e172af",
