          "raw_source_handle": "P0329"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::caf5e2a920fd8e6427e41f2c",
          "source_handle": "P0329",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "候选治疗性菌群的设计逻辑（围绕供体FMT和ICI响应相关物种及机制）及菌株分离培养的进展。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::668c479a5777d8a189e172af",
            "snapshot::7f4d4d07befb7d6373432503"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0329"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::107cddc181c0ebe6140204b3",
          "source_handle": "P0329",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "该研究仅为摘要级别，所有关于“治疗性菌群”的具体成分、作用机制及临床前/临床数据均未知，不得推断其具体功效或安全性。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::668c479a5777d8a189e172af",
            "snapshot::7f4d4d07befb7d6373432503"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0329"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::32be3241aa6be5e4aa9c6909",
          "source_handle": "P0329",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "模型基于回顾性数据，模拟结果不代表真实临床疗效，需明确区分“预测模型中的响应率提升”与“实际患者生存获益”。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::668c479a5777d8a189e172af",
            "snapshot::7f4d4d07befb7d6373432503"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0329"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::1b85f9454a1366e32d8300b8",
          "source_handle": "P0329",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "研究对象限定为NSCLC，其微生物组特征可能与其他实体瘤不同，跨癌种推广需谨慎。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::668c479a5777d8a189e172af",
            "snapshot::7f4d4d07befb7d6373432503"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0329"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::4c5791d22681d874f3bce1ab",
          "source_handle": "P0329",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "作者声称的“promise”为初步概念验证，尚处于菌株分离和培养阶段，距离实际应用仍有距离。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::668c479a5777d8a189e172af",
            "snapshot::7f4d4d07befb7d6373432503"
          ],
